797b9f9ab7a8"],

Cell["\<\
Part 0 - change to grid; not post-processed
Part 1 - change to grid; relative -> What is each rectangular map relative to \
its own area-weighted mean on the comparison grid?
Part 2 - change to grid; GDF flux\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.986582317717021*^9, 3.986582341713978*^9}, {
  3.9869240221417522`*^9, 
  3.9869240236198874`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"b3a7ac75-4c2e-4f6a-ac70-\
1ce859275a19"],

